{"pull": {"id": "number:22580", "number": 22580, "title": "KAFKA-20662: Throw `INCONSISTENT_GROUP_PROTOCOL` for malformed request during online migration", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-06-15T14:52:03Z", "closed_at": "2026-06-23T06:59:29Z", "merged_at": "2026-06-23T06:59:29Z", "user": {"login": "dongnuo123", "id": 139248811, "node_id": "U_kgDOCEzEqw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/139248811?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123", "html_url": "https://github.com/dongnuo123", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dongnuo123/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "When the subscription deserialization fails, we throw an\nIllegalStateException\n```\nprivate static ConsumerProtocolSubscription deserializeSubscription(\n  JoinGroupRequestProtocolCollection protocols\n) {\n  try {\n  return ConsumerProtocol.deserializeConsumerProtocolSubscription(\n    ByteBuffer.wrap(protocols.iterator().next().metadata()));\n  }\n  catch (SchemaException e) {\n  throw new IllegalStateException(\"Malformed embedded consumer protocol\nin subscription deserialization.\");\n  }\n}\n```\nwhich will be translated to UNKNOWN_SERVER_ERROR. This is a bit\nconfusing to the client. We throw a fatal `INCONSISTENT_GROUP_PROTOCOL`\nhere instead.\n\nReviewers: David Jacot <david.jacot@gmail.com>\n", "labels": [{"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 8846059803, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAACD0QpGw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/group-coordinator", "name": "group-coordinator", "color": "9AFD22", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/22580"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/Cherry-pick_is_pr.json"}